{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_001","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"llm_architecture","subtopic":"mha_mqa_gqa","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"用不超过 120 字解释 MHA、MQA、GQA 在 KV 头数量上的区别。","reference":"MHA 为每个查询头保留独立的 K、V 头，表达能力强但 KV cache 最大。MQA 让所有查询头共享一组 K、V，显著减少推理显存和带宽。GQA 把查询头分成若干组，每组共享一组 K、V，是 MHA 效果和 MQA 推理效率之间的折中。","required_keywords":["MHA","MQA","GQA","K","V","KV cache","共享"],"forbidden_keywords":["前额叶","神经元","BM25"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_002","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"llm_architecture","subtopic":"rope","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"RoPE 为什么能表达相对位置信息？","reference":"RoPE 通过按位置旋转 Q、K 向量，把位置信息注入注意力分数。旋转后的 Q 和 K 点积自然包含相对位置信息，因此很适合自回归注意力。","required_keywords":["RoPE","Q","K","旋转","相对位置"],"forbidden_keywords":["BM25","词频","倒排索引"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_003","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"llm_architecture","subtopic":"rmsnorm","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"请说明 RMSNorm 与 LayerNorm 的主要区别。","reference":"LayerNorm 会减去均值并按方差归一化，RMSNorm 只使用均方根做缩放，不显式中心化。RMSNorm 计算更简单，通常足以稳定 LLM 训练。","required_keywords":["RMSNorm","LayerNorm","均方根","归一化","eps"],"forbidden_keywords":["dropout","随机丢弃"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_004","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"llm_architecture","subtopic":"swiglu","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"SwiGLU 相比普通两层 FFN 多了什么结构？","reference":"SwiGLU 是一种带门控的前馈网络，通常用一支 SiLU 激活后的投影去门控另一支投影，再映射回隐藏维度。它比普通 ReLU/GELU FFN 有更强的表达能力。","required_keywords":["SwiGLU","门控","SiLU","FFN","up_proj","down_proj"],"forbidden_keywords":["KV cache","PagedAttention"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_005","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"llm_architecture","subtopic":"dense_vs_moe","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"Dense 模型和 MoE 模型在每个 token 激活参数上有什么区别？","reference":"Dense 模型中每个 token 都经过同一组完整 FFN 参数。MoE 把 FFN 拆成多个专家，每个 token 只路由到少数专家，因此总参数可以很大，但单 token 激活参数较少。","required_keywords":["Dense","MoE","专家","路由","top-k","稀疏激活"],"forbidden_keywords":["全部专家","每个 token 都经过所有专家"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_006","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"moe","subtopic":"routing","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"MoE 的 top-k routing 通常包含哪几个步骤？","reference":"MoE 路由器通常是一个线性层，为每个 token 计算所有专家的 logits。经过 softmax 得到专家权重后，选择 top-k 专家处理该 token，并把专家输出按路由权重加权合并。","required_keywords":["路由器","logits","softmax","top-k","专家","加权"],"forbidden_keywords":["BM25","倒排索引","向量数据库"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_007","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"moe","subtopic":"load_balance","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"为什么 MoE 需要 load balancing auxiliary loss？","reference":"MoE 负载不均衡指路由器总把 token 分给少数专家，导致部分专家过载、部分专家得不到训练。常见缓解方式是加入 load balancing auxiliary loss，鼓励专家接收的 token 占比和路由概率更均匀。","required_keywords":["负载均衡","auxiliary loss","专家","token 占比","capacity"],"forbidden_keywords":["一定均衡","无需监控"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_008","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"peft","subtopic":"lora_core","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"LoRA 如何用低秩矩阵近似权重更新？","reference":"LoRA 冻结原模型权重，只训练低秩增量矩阵，用 BA 近似权重更新 Delta W。前向时等价于原线性层输出加上一个低秩旁路输出。","required_keywords":["LoRA","冻结","低秩","A","B","Delta W"],"forbidden_keywords":["前额叶","神经元","大脑"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_009","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"peft","subtopic":"lora_init_rank","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"LoRA 为什么常用 A 随机、B 为 0 的初始化？","reference":"常见 LoRA 初始化是 A 随机初始化，B 初始化为 0，使训练开始时低秩分支输出为 0，不会突然改变基座模型行为。rank r 控制低秩更新容量。","required_keywords":["A","B","初始化","B 为 0","rank","alpha"],"forbidden_keywords":["必须随机初始化","rank 越大越好"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_010","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"peft","subtopic":"qlora","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"QLoRA 相比普通 LoRA 主要省在哪里？","reference":"QLoRA 通常把冻结的基座模型权重量化到 4bit，同时只训练 LoRA 低秩参数。它减少了基座权重占用的显存，使单卡微调更大的模型成为可能。","required_keywords":["QLoRA","4bit","基座模型","冻结","LoRA","显存"],"forbidden_keywords":["1bit","所有梯度"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_011","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"alignment","subtopic":"sft","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"为什么 SFT 不能完全替代预训练？","reference":"预训练用 next-token prediction 学语言、知识和模式，目标是让模型会续写。SFT 用指令或对话数据训练模型按用户意图回答，目标是让模型学会遵循指令和输出格式。","required_keywords":["预训练","SFT","next-token","指令","格式","质量"],"forbidden_keywords":["不需要预训练","万能"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_012","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"alignment","subtopic":"dpo","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"写出 DPO loss 的核心形式，并说明 chosen/rejected 的作用。","reference":"DPO 是离线偏好优化方法，直接使用 chosen/rejected 成对回答训练策略模型。它把奖励建模和策略优化合并成一个分类式目标，不需要在线 rollout。","required_keywords":["DPO","chosen","rejected","参考模型","log sigmoid","beta"],"forbidden_keywords":["必须在线采样","advantage"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_013","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"alignment","subtopic":"ppo_grpo","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"简要对比 DPO、PPO 和 GRPO。","reference":"PPO 是在线强化学习方法，通常用策略模型生成回答，奖励模型打分，再用优势函数和 KL 约束更新。DPO 是离线偏好优化，不需要 rollout。GRPO 用同一 prompt 的一组回答做相对奖励归一化，减少对独立 value model 的依赖。","required_keywords":["PPO","DPO","GRPO","rollout","奖励","KL"],"forbidden_keywords":["同义词","不带参考模型的 DPO"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_014","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"alignment","subtopic":"reward_hacking","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"为什么 RLHF/PPO 训练 LLM 时常加入 KL 惩罚？","reference":"Reward hacking 指模型找到奖励函数漏洞，获得高奖励但输出质量或真实目标变差。RLHF 中常用 KL 约束限制策略偏离参考模型，减少语言退化和极端投机行为。","required_keywords":["reward hacking","奖励模型","KL","参考模型","人工评估"],"forbidden_keywords":["越高越好","不需要评估"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_015","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"inference","subtopic":"kv_cache","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"KV Cache 为什么能减少自回归生成中的重复计算？","reference":"自回归生成每一步只新增一个 token，历史 token 的 K、V 不会改变。KV Cache 保存历史 K、V，下一步只计算新 token，并用新 Q 去 attend 历史 K、V。","required_keywords":["KV Cache","自回归","K","V","prefill","decode"],"forbidden_keywords":["训练集","词表缓存"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_016","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"inference","subtopic":"paged_attention","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"PagedAttention 如何改善 KV cache 的显存管理？","reference":"PagedAttention 把 KV cache 按块分页管理，类似操作系统的虚拟内存。它避免为每个请求预留连续大块显存，减少碎片并提高并发请求下的显存利用率。","required_keywords":["PagedAttention","KV cache","分页","显存碎片","并发","vLLM"],"forbidden_keywords":["BM25","检索更准","训练损失"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_017","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"inference","subtopic":"flash_attention","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"FlashAttention 和 PagedAttention 的优化对象有什么不同？","reference":"FlashAttention 通过分块计算和优化内存访问，避免显式保存完整 attention 矩阵。它在保持精确 attention 结果的同时减少 HBM 读写和显存占用。","required_keywords":["FlashAttention","分块","HBM","显存","精确 attention"],"forbidden_keywords":["随机丢弃","近似"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_018","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"inference","subtopic":"quantization","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"推理量化为什么需要校准集和任务评估？","reference":"量化把权重或激活从 FP16/BF16 压到 INT8、INT4 等低位宽，减少显存占用和内存带宽压力。有硬件 kernel 支持时，低位矩阵乘法还能提高吞吐。","required_keywords":["量化","INT8","INT4","GPTQ","AWQ","校准"],"forbidden_keywords":["无损","一定不损失","所有 GPU"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_019","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"inference","subtopic":"speculative_decoding","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"投机解码为什么需要 target model 验证 draft token？","reference":"投机解码用小的 draft model 先生成多个候选 token，再由大的 target model 并行验证。被接受的 token 可以一次前进多步，被拒绝时按规则修正。","required_keywords":["投机解码","draft model","target model","验证","接受率"],"forbidden_keywords":["不再调用大模型","直接替代"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_020","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"rag","subtopic":"bm25","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"BM25 打分中 IDF、k1、b 分别大致起什么作用？","reference":"BM25 是经典稀疏检索打分方法，根据查询词在文档中的词频、逆文档频率和文档长度归一化来计算相关性。IDF 提高稀有查询词的权重，词频项有饱和效果。","required_keywords":["BM25","词频","IDF","文档长度","k1","b"],"forbidden_keywords":["Q","K","V","注意力权重"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_021","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"rag","subtopic":"dense_retrieval","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"为什么专业 RAG 常把 BM25 和向量检索混合使用？","reference":"BM25 依赖词面匹配，擅长关键词、术语和精确字符串。embedding 检索把文本编码成向量，按语义相似度召回，擅长同义改写和概念相近的问题。","required_keywords":["BM25","embedding","语义","关键词","hybrid","reranker"],"forbidden_keywords":["完全替代","没有价值"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_022","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"rag","subtopic":"chunking","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"RAG 中 chunk 太大或太小分别有什么问题？","reference":"RAG 文档切分要在语义完整性和召回精度之间折中。chunk 太大容易引入噪声，太小可能丢失上下文；overlap 能缓解边界切断问题。","required_keywords":["chunk","overlap","召回","reranker","上下文"],"forbidden_keywords":["越大越好","整本文档"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_023","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"rag","subtopic":"rag_evaluation","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"为什么 RAG 评估要拆分检索质量和生成质量？","reference":"RAG 评估要拆成检索和生成两部分。检索看相关文档是否被召回、排序是否靠前；生成看答案是否正确、是否基于上下文、是否给出可追溯引用。","required_keywords":["RAG","recall@k","排序","faithfulness","引用"],"forbidden_keywords":["一定可信","无需评估"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
