{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_025","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"vlm","subtopic":"vit_patch","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"ViT 的 patch embedding 把图像变成了什么形式？","reference":"ViT 把图像切成固定大小的 patch，将每个 patch 展平并线性投影成 token embedding，再加位置编码送入 Transformer。这样图像被转成类似文本 token 的序列。","required_keywords":["ViT","patch","embedding","位置编码","Transformer"],"forbidden_keywords":["每个像素","50176 个 token"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_026","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"vlm","subtopic":"llava","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"LLaVA 中视觉 encoder、projector、LLM 分别承担什么作用？","reference":"LLaVA 通常由视觉编码器、视觉投影层和语言模型组成。视觉编码器提取图像特征，projector 把视觉特征映射到 LLM hidden space，再作为视觉 token 与文本 token 一起输入 LLM。","required_keywords":["LLaVA","视觉编码器","projector","LLM","视觉 token"],"forbidden_keywords":["base64","文件路径直接"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
