{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_028","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"vlm","subtopic":"vlm_hallucination","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"列举三类常见 VLM 幻觉，并说明一个缓解思路。","reference":"VLM 幻觉包括不存在的物体、错误属性、数量错误、空间关系错误和 OCR 误读。原因可能是视觉分辨率不足、图像特征对齐弱、训练数据偏差或语言先验过强。","required_keywords":["VLM","幻觉","物体","空间关系","OCR","grounding"],"forbidden_keywords":["不会产生","只要语言模型足够大"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
