{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_031","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"vla","subtopic":"diffusion_policy","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"Diffusion Policy 为什么比直接回归动作更适合多峰动作分布？","reference":"Diffusion Policy 把动作序列生成看成条件去噪过程，从噪声逐步还原未来一段动作。它能表达多峰动作分布，适合抓取和操作中存在多种可行动作轨迹的场景。","required_keywords":["Diffusion Policy","动作序列","去噪","多峰","receding horizon"],"forbidden_keywords":["目标图片","画机器人"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_032","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"vla","subtopic":"action_tokenization","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"VLA 中把连续动作离散成 action tokens 有什么好处和风险？","reference":"VLA 动作可以表示为连续控制向量、离散动作类别、离散化后的 action tokens，或高层计划加低层控制器。动作 tokenization 把连续动作分桶或编码成 token，使语言模型可以像生成文本一样生成动作。","required_keywords":["动作","tokenization","连续","离散","控制量","量化误差"],"forbidden_keywords":["中文词语","普通文字"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_033","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"agent","subtopic":"react","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"ReAct 中 Thought、Action、Observation 分别代表什么？","reference":"ReAct 把推理和行动交替组织：模型先思考下一步，再调用工具或执行动作，然后观察结果并继续推理。它让语言推理能被外部环境反馈修正。","required_keywords":["ReAct","Thought","Action","Observation","工具","反馈"],"forbidden_keywords":["越长越好","无限"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_034","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"agent","subtopic":"tool_calling_schema","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"为什么函数调用训练需要固定工具 schema 和参数校验？","reference":"Tool Calling 要求模型在合适时机输出结构化工具名和参数，而不是只生成自然语言。模型要学会判断是否需要工具、选择工具、填写参数，并根据返回结果继续回答。","required_keywords":["Tool Calling","工具","schema","JSON","参数","返回结果"],"forbidden_keywords":["自己发明工具","随便编 API"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_035","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"agent","subtopic":"agent_memory","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"Agent 的长期记忆为什么需要写入规则和过期机制？","reference":"Agent 记忆常分为短期上下文、长期向量记忆、任务状态记忆和用户偏好记忆。短期上下文用于当前对话，长期记忆用于跨会话检索经验或用户信息。","required_keywords":["Agent","短期上下文","长期记忆","向量","隐私","过期"],"forbidden_keywords":["永久写入","越多越好"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_036","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"agent","subtopic":"agentic_rl","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"Agentic RL 为什么比单轮 RLHF 更需要 trajectory 日志？","reference":"普通 RLHF 多优化单轮回答偏好；Agentic RL 更关注多步任务中规划、工具调用和最终任务完成。它需要环境、工具或验证器反馈来判断行动是否有效。","required_keywords":["Agentic RL","多步","工具调用","环境反馈","trajectory","奖励"],"forbidden_keywords":["只需要最终文本","单轮"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_037","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"training_engineering","subtopic":"mixed_precision","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"为什么 8GB 显存训练 LLM 通常不优先选 FP32？","reference":"FP32 数值范围和精度高，但显存和带宽开销大。FP16 更省显存但数值范围小，容易溢出，需要 loss scaling。BF16 保留接近 FP32 的指数范围，同时节省显存，训练更稳。","required_keywords":["FP32","FP16","BF16","显存","数值范围","loss scaling"],"forbidden_keywords":["更聪明","大幅提升知识"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_038","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"training_engineering","subtopic":"gradient_accumulation","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"梯度累积如何用小显存模拟更大的 batch？","reference":"梯度累积把多个 micro batch 的梯度累加后再更新一次参数，用较小显存模拟更大的 effective batch。effective batch size 等于 micro batch size 乘以累积步数再乘以数据并行卡数。","required_keywords":["梯度累积","micro batch","effective batch","optimizer step","显存"],"forbidden_keywords":["任意大模型","增加模型容量"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_039","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"training_engineering","subtopic":"checkpointing","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"训练时为什么通常只保留 last、best 和少数里程碑 checkpoint？","reference":"中间 checkpoint 用于断点恢复、回退到更好阶段和分析训练退化。它保存模型权重、优化器状态、step 和训练配置。","required_keywords":["checkpoint","断点恢复","优化器状态","last","best","eval"],"forbidden_keywords":["永久保留","越多越安全"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_040","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"training_engineering","subtopic":"data_mixture","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"为什么给小模型做 AI 专业 SFT 时仍要混入通用数据？","reference":"专业 SFT 要提高目标领域能力，但不能完全挤掉通用对话和基础语言能力。小模型容量有限，专业数据比例过高会导致偏科、模板化和灾难性遗忘。","required_keywords":["专业 SFT","通用数据","配比","灾难性遗忘","固定 eval"],"forbidden_keywords":["只需要专业数据","越少越好"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_041","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"training_engineering","subtopic":"validation_loss","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"训练 loss 降低但固定 eval 变差，通常说明什么？","reference":"训练 loss 只说明模型更适应训练数据，validation loss 和固定 eval 才能反映泛化。训练 loss 下降但评测变差，可能是过拟合、数据污染、学习率过高或训练分布偏移。","required_keywords":["validation loss","训练 loss","过拟合","固定 eval","早停"],"forbidden_keywords":["一定越正确","只看训练 loss"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_042","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"tokenizer","subtopic":"bpe_vocab","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"为什么把 8k tokenizer 换成 16k 往往需要重新训练？","reference":"BPE 从字符或字节级 token 开始，反复合并语料中高频相邻 token 对，形成子词词表。合适的 tokenizer 能减少序列长度，并让常见术语被更稳定地表示。","required_keywords":["BPE","vocab","子词","序列长度","embedding","checkpoint"],"forbidden_keywords":["不影响训练","免费提升"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_043","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"tokenizer","subtopic":"special_tokens","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"为什么 SFT 和推理必须保持同一套 chat template？","reference":"Special tokens 用于明确对话边界、角色、开始结束和工具调用结构。SFT 中 user/assistant 标记能让模型区分用户输入和需要学习生成的助手输出。","required_keywords":["special tokens","user","assistant","chat template","loss mask","EOS"],"forbidden_keywords":["随便改","给人看的"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_044","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"scaling_law","subtopic":"data_compute","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"为什么 SFT 数据规模增加不一定带来更好的专业能力？","reference":"Scaling Law 的启发是参数量、数据量和算力要匹配。3 亿参数模型如果只看很少 token，通常仍然欠训练；但 SFT 阶段不是简单越大越好，质量和分布更关键。","required_keywords":["Scaling Law","参数量","数据量","预训练","SFT","质量"],"forbidden_keywords":["越多越好","错误答案能平均掉"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_045","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"distributed_training","subtopic":"deepspeed_zero","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"DeepSpeed ZeRO 为什么主要在多卡训练中节省显存？","reference":"DeepSpeed ZeRO 通过把优化器状态、梯度和参数在数据并行卡之间分片，减少每张卡上的冗余显存。Stage 越高，分片对象越多，显存越省但通信更复杂。","required_keywords":["DeepSpeed","ZeRO","优化器状态","梯度","参数分片","Stage 3"],"forbidden_keywords":["自动更快","单卡像多卡"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_046","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"evaluation","subtopic":"fixed_eval","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"固定 eval set 对比较不同 checkpoint 有什么价值？","reference":"固定 eval set 能让不同 checkpoint 在同一批问题上比较，避免每次凭感觉换题。专业知识模型需要覆盖概念解释、对比、公式、误区纠正和工程边界。","required_keywords":["固定 eval","checkpoint","关键词","禁忌词","人工评估"],"forbidden_keywords":["不需要测试","只看 loss"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
{"id":"ai_expert_eval_v2_047","source":"curated_ai_expert_eval_v2","topic":"data_quality","subtopic":"sft_quality","task_type":"concept_regression","difficulty":"basic","prompt":"为什么 AI 专业 SFT 数据要做术语统一和误区样本？","reference":"高质量 SFT 数据应单样本单知识点、答案准确、术语一致、格式稳定、长度适中，并覆盖多种问法。专业知识尤其要避免把相邻概念混在一起。","required_keywords":["SFT","去重","术语一致","事实检查","train/eval","去污染"],"forbidden_keywords":["直接当 SFT","只要出现词"],"min_required_keyword_recall":0.55,"max_new_tokens":160}
